---
<AeoGuide
  slug="dealer-training"
  title="Dealer Training | Line Training, Merchandising, Cyncly 2020"
  description="In-person line training, merchandising, and Cyncly 2020 support from Pinnacle Sales. Fill out the form and we will get you on the calendar."
  heading="Dealer Training"
  lede="We train on the floor, on the lines you carry."
  faqs={faqs}
>

<p>Pinnacle Sales trains dealer teams on the brands they open. Gillian Patriquin leads training across the territory. Your sales rep stays with you.</p>

<h2>What we cover</h2>
<p>Line training, merchandising, Cyncly 2020, and factory visits. The work happens in your showroom and at the plant, not on a webinar left in a shared folder.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>In-person line training</strong> on the showroom floor for the brands you open.</li>
  <li><strong>Merchandising</strong> so displays sell Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Vistora, and the other public brands you choose.</li>
  <li><strong>Cyncly 2020</strong> design and quoting support when the spec gets complicated.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Who to ask</h2>
<p><a href="/about/">Gillian Patriquin</a> is Dealer and Training Specialist, all territories, based in Northern Colorado. Territory sales still sit with the rep on your account.</p>

<h2>Getting on the calendar</h2>
<p>Tell us what you want: a showroom session, a factory visit, or time in Cyncly 2020. Fill out the form and we will schedule it. For factory context, see <a href="/guides/ww-wood-factory/">WW Wood in Dudley</a>.</p>

</AeoGuide>
